<title>UK: Rentokil buys Butler Powered Access.</title>
<headline>Rentokil buys Butler Powered Access.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British pest control, security and business services group Rentokil Initial Plc said on Monday it had bought British work platforms supplier Butler Powered Access for 2.5 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
